# AirWatch India — Environment Configuration Template
# Copy this file to .env to configure optional ground-station features.

# Optional: WAQI (World Air Quality Index) Token for continuous ground-station feeds
# Register free at: https://aqicn.org/data-platform/token/
# Note: Default Open-Meteo telemetry functions 100% out-of-the-box with NO API KEY.
WAQI_API_TOKEN=your_token_here
